 "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "890547815531463"}]}, "change_log": "- Week 1 Patch -\n\t*Fix Bricks occasionally going to origin on grab\n\t*Fix Social app being available during tutorials\n\t*Fix multiple tutorial bugs\n\t*Screen fader fix for standalone builds\n\t*Improved textures for standalone builds\n\t*Avatar holograms in Duels fixed\n\nPrice Reduction\n\t*Game Price has been permanently reduced\n\nSteam Release\n\t*Game is now also available on Steam, and some networking and unity services features have been change to accommodate it\n\nParts\n\t*Added 3 new basic parts available to everyone automatically\n\nLeaderboards\n\t*Rift activity leaderboards added for remaining activities\n\nProgression Updates\n\t*Added new 4 new objectives under Tier 2 as Path 6\n\t*Objectives unlock 4 new paints\n\nStore\n\t*2 New Paints added to store\n\t*6 New Avatars added to store (2 are free)\n\nFriends System\n\t*Added in-game friends system (with backend changes to allow for seamless interaction with Steam users)\n\nLIV\n\t*Added LIV integration to all platforms\n\nUI/UX\n\t*Added test option to gizmo scannable menu and gizmo item card (my gizmos)\n\nQoL Improvements\n\t*New Respawn Screen in the Rift for faster play\n\t*New Portals and exit/quit game options\n\t*Player Scannable now have add friend option\n\t*Player Nametags now have platform indicator\n\t*Hybrid Locomotion set as default for new players\n\nOther Fixes\n\t*Xumi Collection Quest bug fixes\n\t*Hit System fixes\n\t*Avatar fixes\n\t*Networking fixes\n\t*Reworked strings for FTE & Epilogue\n\nPerformance Improvements\n\t*Improved Multiple Performance aspects\n\nOther\n\t*Technical Improvements\n\t*General improvements and bug fixes\n\n", "created_date": 1790866928, "id": "29631611929771913", "version": "0.11.1", "version_code": 22430, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "29631601193106320"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "6784970791529351", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29631611929771913"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1790857973, "id": "29630043303262109", "version": "0.11.1", "version_code": 22428, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "29630034906596282"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}